# Allowlist: everything is ignored unless listed below.
# New test scripts, data, builds and anything else stay out of git (and out of
# this public repo) by default. To publish a file, add a "!name" line for it.
# Files that are already tracked stay tracked whatever this file says.
*
!*/

!.gitignore
!README.md
!makefile

# C pattern programs built by the makefile
!pattern.cpp
!pattern[0-9].cpp
!pattern10.cpp
!PQ.cpp

# Bit depth animation
!animation.sh
!animation/
!animation/*.png
